  Anthropic Authentication
  Current: API key + OAuth

› 1. Use API key      Remove OAuth credentials and keep the stored API key.
  2. Remove API key   Delete the stored key for this provider.
  3. Switch to OAuth  Continue authentication in your browser. Replaces the API key.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
